  "adaptations": {
    "vu": "Original Execute, opcode, pipeline, XGKICK transfer scheduling and packet parser; final GIF transport only copied into length-prefixed capture. Host Mem/Micro pointers zeroed in serialized register output. Per-call JSON retains native caller/TOP/ITOP, cycle and transport chunk boundaries.",
    "ee": "Original single-instruction interpreter, branch/delay and COP1/COP2 implementations; vtlb transport redirects to explicit32MiBRAM/16KiBscratchpad; direct async event callback inert, IOP executor inert, counter deadlinesINT_MAX; originalVU providers initialized.",
    "gs": "Official software renderer13, zeroed version8 freeze with explicit VRAM uploads/context GIF events; unfiltered nativeRT RGB and separate nativealphaL decoded into rawRGBA; no network or host display. Readback waits for native third-frame VSync snapshot completion, including finished raw alpha output.",
    "runtime": "Strict official AppImage and ELF SHA checks before any ABI offsets are used; isolated container scoped to source/input/output mounts."
